1
00:00:00,417 --> 00:00:02,347
(Raj:)Me too.

2
00:00:02,519 --> 00:00:04,779
(Leonard:)Okay, I am Dr. Leonard Hofstadter.

3
00:00:04,955 --> 00:00:09,985
I'm here with my friends, Dr. Cooper,
and real-life astronaut Howard Wolowitz.

4
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:15,120
(Leonard:)And we are going to show you girls
how cool ajob in science can be.

5
00:00:15,298 --> 00:00:16,488
(Leonard:)How cool, you ask?

6
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:19,657
(Leonard:)Well, how about negative 273 degrees...

7
00:00:19,836 --> 00:00:23,896
...because that's the temperature at which
entropy reaches its minimum value.

8
00:00:26,943 --> 00:00:31,313
(Leonard:)Did I just learn something new
and have fun doing it? What?

9
00:00:34,217 --> 00:00:36,347
(Leonard:)All right.

10
00:00:37,487 --> 00:00:43,487
(Leonard:)So now let's bring out theoretical physicist,
Dr. Sheldon Cooper!

11
00:00:48,432 --> 00:00:50,062
(Sheldon:)Hello, female children.

12
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:54,202
(Sheldon:)Allow me to inspire you...

